:: Widgets Colosseum Breeding [widget]
<!--
	Underground Colosseum breeding layer.
	- Pills follow the body: the Bull dose is Blue for a body with no penis
	  and Gray otherwise, the Breeder dose is Pink for a body with no vagina and Gray otherwise. NPCs follow the same rule.
	- House doses run 2 days. A Purple dose (herm effect) already covers both, so nothing is added on top of it.
	- $xchange.colosseum.breed is "", "accept", "skip", "deny" or "bred" for the bout in progress. New fields are read with ?? 0.
	- Chastity devices carry origin "Colosseum" and are only ever removed here if they still carry it.
-->
<<widget "colosseumBeltOn">>
	<<if !playerChastity()>>
		<<forceChastityFit "Colosseum">>
		<<set $xchange.colosseum.beltFitted to 1>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "colosseumBeltOff">>
	<<if $xchange.colosseum.beltFitted>>
		<<unset $xchange.colosseum.beltFitted>>
		<<if $worn.genitals.origin is "Colosseum">>
			<<set $worn.genitals to clone(setup.clothes.genitals[0])>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<!-- Give the player a house dose. Arg 1: "bull" or "breeder". Arg 2: "voluntary" when the player chose to swallow it, so Gray Agent does not block it.
	 House gray doses never flip the body, whatever the "Gray pills flip sex" setting says. -->
<<widget "colosseumPlayerPill">>
	<<set _pillBull to _args[0] is "bull">>
	<<set _pillVoluntary to _args[1] is "voluntary">>
	<<set _pillGrayFlip to $xchange.grayPillGenderflip>><<set $xchange.grayPillGenderflip to 0>>
	<<if _pillVoluntary>><<xchange-dose-deliberate>><</if>>
	<<if playerIsXChanged()>>
		<<if !$xchange.pill.hermEffect and !pillIsPermanent()>>
			<<if _pillBull>><<xchange-gray 2 "bull">><<else>><<xchange-gray 2 "breeder" "fertile">><</if>>
		<</if>>
	<<elseif _pillBull>>
		<<if $player.penisExist>><<xchange-gray 2 "bull">><<else>><<xchange-blue 2 "bull">><</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<if $player.vaginaExist>><<xchange-gray 2 "breeder" "fertile">><<else>><<xchange-pink 2 "breeder" "fertile">><</if>>
	<</if>>
	<<if _pillVoluntary>><<xchange-dose-deliberate-end>><</if>>
	<<set $xchange.grayPillGenderflip to _pillGrayFlip>>
<</widget>>

<!-- Give an NPC a house dose. Arg 1: "bull" or "breeder". Arg 2: their $NPCList slot. -->
<<widget "colosseumNpcPill">>
	<<set _pillSlot to _args[1] ?? 0>>
	<<set _pillGender to $NPCList[_pillSlot].gender>>
	<<npc-select-xchange-target _pillSlot>>
	<<if _args[0] is "bull">>
		<<if _pillGender is "f">><<npc-take-xchange 2 "genderflip" "bull">><<else>><<npc-take-xchange 2 "bull">><</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<if _pillGender is "m">><<npc-take-xchange 2 "genderflip" "breeder" "fertile">><<else>><<npc-take-xchange 2 "breeder" "fertile">><</if>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<!-- Antidote out, Purple in. Sets $xchangeAntidoteFizzle when the running dose cannot be shifted. -->
<<widget "colosseumPurpleSwap">>
	<<xchange-antidote 7>>
	<<if !$xchangeAntidoteFizzle>>
		<<xchange-restore>>
		<<take-xchange 2 "herm" "breeder" "fertile" "bull">>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

:: Underground Colosseum Intro Finish
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "colosseum">><<effects>><<colosseumHost>>
<<set _loserMale to random(0, 1) is 1>><<set _winnerFemale to random(0, 1) is 1>>
In the pit, the fighter who took the punch stops trying to get up. The other climbs on top, pins both arms to the sand and pushes a hand between the loser's legs. The loser's back arches and they come with their mouth open and the whole room watching.<<arousal 400>><<garousal>>
<br><br>
You find you are gripping the rail. The crowd is on its feet. The chant starts in the front row and spreads back through the seats: "Breed them! Breed them! Breed them!"
<br><br>
Two attendants climb over the barrier. One holds the loser's jaw while the other pushes a <<if _loserMale>>pink<<else>>gray<</if>> capsule into their mouth and keeps it shut until they swallow.<<if _loserMale>> The loser's body has started to change before the capsule is gone.<</if>> The winner is handed a <<if _winnerFemale>>blue<<else>>gray<</if>> capsule and takes it without being held down.
<br><br>
A <<person>> in a waistcoat soon pushes through the spectators towards you. <<He>> places a hand around your elbow and pulls you away from the seats.
"You're new. If you're only here to watch, don't stand here too long. The staff will assume you're looking for a fight."
<br><br>
<<He>> leads you towards a desk at the side of the room. A row of wire cages stands behind it. Clothes, shoes, bags, and other personal belongings have been placed inside them.
<br><br>
<<He>> points towards the cages.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Underground Colosseum Intro 2]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Underground Colosseum Breed Offer
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "colosseum">><<effects>><<person1>><<pass 1>>
<<set _bullColour to $player.penisExist ? "gray" : "blue">>
<<set _breedColour to $NPCList[0].gender is "m" ? "pink" : "gray">>
<<unset $xchange.colosseum.breed>>
Your opponent stays down. The referee finishes the count, lifts your wrist and steps back. Nobody in the room sits. The chant starts in the front row and fills the room: "Breed them! Breed them! Breed them!"
<br><br>
An attendant drops two keys and two capsules onto the sand by your feet. One key opens the chastity device on you and the other opens <<his>>. The <<print _bullColour>> capsule is a Bull pill, for you. The <<print _breedColour>> capsule is a Breeder pill, for <<him>>.
<<if playerIsXChanged() and $xchange.pill.hermEffect>>You are still on the Purple dose, so you do not need yours.<<elseif !$player.penisExist and !playerIsXChanged() and !xchangePregnancyBlocksPill() and !xchangePillProtectionActive()>>The blue pill will give you a cock to use.<</if>>
<<if $NPCList[0].gender is "m">>The pink pill will give <<him>> a womb to carry with.<</if>>
<br><br>
The room waits to see what you do. An attendant points towards the fighters' desk. "You can leave it there and take half the purse and points. Your win still counts."
<br><br>
<<link [[Take the pill and breed <<him>>|Underground Colosseum Breed Win]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Take the reduced fight purse|Underground Colosseum Result]]>><<set $xchange.colosseum.breed to "skip">><</link>><<note "Half purse and ranking points; no ban">>
<br>
<<link [[Reject the house's terms|Underground Colosseum Breed Deny]]>><</link>><<note "No purse or ranking points; the house bans you for good" "red">>
<br>

:: Underground Colosseum Breed Win
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "colosseum">><<effects>><<person1>><<pass 15>>
<<set _onPurple to playerIsXChanged() and $xchange.pill.hermEffect>>
<<set _hadPenis to $player.penisExist>>
<<set _npcFlips to $NPCList[0].gender is "m">>
<<colosseumPlayerPill "bull" "voluntary">>
<<colosseumNpcPill "breeder" 0>>
<<person1>>
<<colosseumBeltOff>>
You pick up your capsule and swallow it dry.
<<if _onPurple>>
	It adds nothing to what the Purple dose is already doing.
<<elseif !$player.penisExist>>
	You wait for the change, but your body will not take the dose.
<<elseif !_hadPenis>>
	Your hips tighten and something forms between your legs, thick and heavy, until your body treats it as its own.
<<else>>
	Heat spreads down from your stomach and your cock stiffens until it aches.
<</if>>
<<if $xchange.pill.bullEffect>>The need to breed comes with it. Stopping feels like the wrong idea.<</if>>
<br><br>
You unlock your own device first, then <<his>>. An attendant holds <<his>> jaw and feeds <<him>> the other capsule.
<<if _npcFlips>>Within a minute <<his>> body is reshaping itself on the sand: <<his>> hips widen and <<his>> chest softens, and <<he>> stops fighting the change and starts breathing through it.<</if>>
<<Hes>> still winded from the bout and does not stop you when you push <<him>> onto <<his>> back. The crowd starts to count out loud. They want to see you finish.<<if $xchange.pill.bullEffect>> The pill has already made the decision for you.<</if>><<arousal 500>><<garousal>>
<br><br>
<<set $xchange.colosseum.breed to "accept">><<colosseumHeat 2>>
<<link [[Next|Underground Colosseum Result]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Underground Colosseum Breed Deny
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "colosseum">><<effects>><<person1>><<pass 2>>
<<set $xchange.colosseum.breed to "deny">>
You let the keys lie where they fell and step back from the capsules.
<br><br>
For a few seconds nothing happens. Then someone in the front row starts booing, and the rest of the room follows. Betting slips land on the sand around you.
<br><br>
A microphone crackles. The announcer apologises to the room for "a difficulty with the winner" and promises the next bout will be worth the wait. By the gate, three goons stop watching the crowd and start walking towards you.<<colosseumBackDown 80>><<stress 6>><<ggstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Underground Colosseum Result]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Underground Colosseum Breed Loss
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "colosseum">><<effects>><<person1>><<pass 15>>
<<set _oppFemale to $NPCList[0].gender is "f">>
<<set _breedColour to $player.vaginaExist ? "gray" : "pink">>
<<set _hadVagina to $player.vaginaExist>>
<<colosseumNpcPill "bull" 0>>
<<person1>>
<<colosseumPlayerPill "breeder">>
<<set _playerFlips to !_hadVagina and $player.vaginaExist>>
<<colosseumBeltOff>>
Your legs will not hold you. The referee counts you out, lifts your opponent's wrist and leaves the sand. The chant begins before the gate has closed: "Breed them! Breed them! Breed them!"
<br><br>
An attendant drops two keys and two capsules beside your opponent, not beside you. Two more pin your arms. A hand closes your nose until you open your mouth, and a <<print _breedColour>> capsule goes in. They hold your jaw shut until you swallow.
<<if _playerFlips>>Your body changes on the sand while they hold you: your hips widen, your chest fills out, and a wet heat opens low in your belly.<</if>>
<<He>> swallows the other capsule without being held, then opens your chastity device with one of the keys.
<br><br>
<<Hes>> not in a hurry. You cannot push <<him>> off<<if $xchange.pill.breederEffect>>, and the pill has already made your body answer before you do<</if>>.<<arousal 500>><<garousal>><<stress 10>><<ggstress>>
<br><br>
<<set $xchange.colosseum.breed to "bred">><<set $xchange.colosseum.bredPending to 1>><<set $xchange.colosseum.bredBirths to $pregnancyStats.playerChildren>>
<<famesex 15 "none" true>><<fameexhibitionism 6 "none" true>><<colosseumHeat 2>>
<<link [[Next|Underground Colosseum Result]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Colosseum Deny Goons
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "colosseum">><<effects>><<pass 1>>
<<generateRole 0 "brisk" "guard">><<generateRole 1 "heavy" "guard">><<generateRole 2 "bored" "guard">>
<<controlloss>><<violence 1>><<neutral 1>><<maninit>>
<<set $enemyanger += 100>>
The three goons reach you together. The one in front says nothing and swings. There is no referee on this side of the barrier, and your clothes are in a cage on the far wall.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Colosseum Deny Goons Fight]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Colosseum Deny Goons Fight
<<effects>><<effectsman>><<man>><<stateman>>
<br><br>
<<actionsman>>
<<if _combatend>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Colosseum Deny Goons Result]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Colosseum Deny Goons Fight]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>

:: Colosseum Deny Goons Result
<<effects>><<pass 5>>
<<set _victory to $enemyhealth lte 0 or $enemypleasure gte $enemypleasuremax>>
<<set $xchange.colosseum.ending to "walked">><<set $xchange.colosseum.banReason to "refused">>
<<if _victory>>
	The last goon goes down against the cages. You take your clothes from the cage, force the delivery door with your shoulder and run up the ramp into the alley.<<famescrap 6 "none" true>>
	<br><br>
	Behind you, an attendant is already taking your name off the board. <span class="red">The house has banned you for good.</span>
	<br><br>
	<<clotheson>><<endcombat>>
	<<link [[Leave|Industrial Alleyways]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	You end up on the concrete with your arms over your head. The goons keep kicking until someone tells them to stop, then pick you up by the arms.<<colosseumInjure 2 3>><<trauma 4>><<gtrauma>>
	<br><br>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<link [[The goons carry you towards the grey door|Underground Colosseum Detention]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>

:: Underground Colosseum Trial Loss
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "colosseum">><<effects>><<pass 5>>
The goon takes your arm and does not let go.
<br><br>
"Nobody leaves after the trial," the goon says. "Everyone who loses it gets one more bout, against somebody on the card. You're a fighter now, so you get treated like one."
<br><br>
The goon walks you back along the corridor and recites the rules without looking at you. No breeding until the referee has called the bout. Break that rule and you do not walk home. The chastity device stays on until the winner opens it, because nobody is to be made pregnant before the crowd has paid to watch.
The winner gets both keys and both capsules, and does as they like with the loser.
<br><br>
<<link [[Follow the goon to the gate|Underground Colosseum Trial Loss 2]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Underground Colosseum Trial Loss 2
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "colosseum">><<effects>><<colosseumOpponent 0>><<pass 3>>
<<strip>><<colosseumBeltOn>>
<<set $daily.colosseumFights to ($daily.colosseumFights ?? 0) + 1>><<set $xchange.colosseum.mock to 0>><<set $xchange.colosseum.fightStart to 1>><<set $xchange.colosseum.matchRank to 0>><<set $xchange.colosseum.opponentRank to 0>>
The goon stops at the gate and checks the lock on your device against the key, twice. On the other side of the pit your opponent is already waiting, locked into one as well.
<br><br>
The announcer reads out the name the crowd knows you by. Someone near the barrier screams it back. The bell rings and both gates open.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Underground Colosseum Fight]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Underground Colosseum Goon Key
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "colosseum">><<effects>><<colosseumHost>><<pass 2>>
<<loadNPC 1 "colosseum_opponent">>
<<person1>>
The goon is on the sand holding the barrier, trying to work out which way is up. The receptionist reaches you first and holds your arm in the air until the room cheers.
<<if $fame.scrap gte 500>>"That's about what I expected from you," <<he>> says.<</if>>
<br><br>
<<He>> puts a small key in your palm. "It opens the goon's belt. The one who tried to drag you in here."
<<He>> looks at the goon and back at you. "You can put the goon back in it, or you can see what that belt was hiding. The house won't mind either way."
<br><br>
<<link [[Take the key|Underground Colosseum Goon Breeding]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Give the key back|Underground Colosseum Goon Key Deny]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Underground Colosseum Goon Key Deny
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "colosseum">><<effects>><<person1>>
The receptionist looks at the key in your hand, then at you, and lets out a long breath when you hold it out.
<br><br>
"Nothing? After that? Somebody like you, leaving all that on the table." <<He>> takes the key and drops it in a pocket. "What a waste. If you change your mind, you know where the door is."
<br><br>
An attendant takes you by the elbow and leads you back along the corridor. The goon is helped off the sand behind you.
<br><br>
<<colosseumBeltOff>><<clotheson>>
<<link [[Next|Underground Colosseum Pit]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Underground Colosseum Goon Breeding
